	'k09adc42d' => 'We accept all major credit and debit cards on the day of your scan, and bank transfers are available for referring healthcare institutions and corporate accounts. For patients holding qualifying private healthcare policies, we can bill approved referrals directly to your insurance provider upon presentation of valid policy details and pre-authorisation documents. Following every appointment, we provide a fully itemised medical receipt detailing the procedure codes and clinical services rendered, enabling self-pay patients to claim applicable reimbursement through private health insurance plans or statutory medical tax relief schemes. We understand that unexpected schedule changes happen. Appointments may be cancelled or rescheduled without any fee or penalty up to 24 hours before your scheduled arrival time. Because our appointment slots are dedicated to individual patients to maintain calm operating conditions and protect our same-day reporting commitments, we ask that you contact our reception team as early as possible if you cannot attend. You can reschedule by telephoning our reception desk at +353 1 555 0148 or emailing hello@nagi-imaging.example during operating hours.',
