	'k33be08a8' => 'Our magnetic resonance imaging service covers neurological, musculoskeletal, and body studies, with standard appointment slots running between 30 and 45 minutes. Computed tomography provides high-resolution cross-sectional imaging for thoracic, abdominal, and skeletal investigations, with contrast administration managed on-site when clinically indicated. Because diagnostic clarity depends on thorough interpretation, every CT and MRI scan performed at Calder Quay is independently examined by two consultant radiologists. Scans completed before 15:00 receive a finalized, signed report by 18:00 the same working day, ensuring referring doctors have the detailed findings they need before clinics close for the evening.',
