	'k51c04138' => 'on the study.',
	'k51fac391' => 'Our operating model is purposefully constrained: we serve clinics within our local community rather than operating an anonymous regional volume service. This deliberate focus allows our clinical team to ensure that every scan completed before 15:00 is read, verified through independent consultant double reading for CT and MRI, and securely transmitted to the referring physician by 18:00. By keeping our reading room directly connected to local doctors, we eliminate administrative lag, reduce agonizing waiting periods for patients, and help clinicians formulate clear treatment pathways on the very day of consultation.',
