	'k59de5af9' => 'Our specialist medical team includes Dr. Lukas Brenner and Dr. Siobhán Kerr. Dr. Brenner is a consultant radiologist specializing in musculoskeletal imaging, providing detailed diagnostic assessments for complex spinal, joint, and sports injuries referred by regional clinicians and physiotherapists. Dr. Siobhán Kerr is a consultant radiologist with dedicated subspecialty training in breast imaging and high-resolution diagnostic ultrasound. Working collaboratively in our reading room, Dr. Brenner, Dr. Kerr, and Dr. Haddad deliver prompt second readings across cross-sectional studies, ensuring every case benefits from focused consultant oversight before the final report is signed.',
