	'k68341e0a' => 'Calder Quay.',
	'k6a4524fc' => 'DEXA scans assess bone mineral density across the lumbar spine and proximal femur, generating standard T-score and Z-score evaluations to support the clinical management of osteopenia and osteoporosis. Our dedicated breast service pairs full-field digital mammography with targeted bilateral breast ultrasound in a single appointment, conducted in a calm and private clinical environment. Studies are reviewed by specialist radiologists experienced in breast and skeletal imaging. Reports contain comprehensive measurements, comparative assessments, and clear anatomical findings sent directly to the referring doctor through our secure digital portal.',
	'k6aa1e2b8' => 'before it comes.',
	'k6c4454c3' => 'Each report is structured into distinct, readable sections: clinical history, technique, detailed anatomical findings, and an overarching impression. Rather than offering speculative conclusions, our radiologists compare current scans against previous examinations whenever earlier images are supplied, documenting interval stability or change. Reports conclude with concise, objective recommendations that assist the clinician with treatment planning without speculative claims. If an unexpected or urgent finding is identified during review, our duty radiologist immediately telephones the referring doctor within the hour to discuss the case directly, ensuring patient safety remains paramount.',
	'k6cc7cc09' => 'Before your scan',
	'k6e0a3cf7' => 'By study',
