	'k8186879b' => 'report only, images uploaded by your doctor',
	'k81958212' => 'Located at Grand Canal Dock in Dublin 2, our outpatient imaging centre is open six days a week for scheduled appointments, referral inquiries, and clinical consultations.',
	'k81db239a' => 'closed on Sundays.',
	'k82447075' => 'Findings, an impression, a comparison with prior images when they are supplied, and a recommendation to the referrer. It describes what the images show; it never promises an outcome.',
	'k82f5a1da' => 'Ultrasound and digital general radiography',
	'k831cee92' => 'Please arrive 15 minutes prior to your scheduled scan time to complete any remaining administrative paperwork or clinical screening forms. Bring a valid form of photographic identification, your doctor\'s written referral letter if it was not submitted electronically, and any previous imaging discs, films, or printed reports relating to your current condition. If your scan is covered by private medical insurance, bring your membership card and pre-authorisation number. Our reception team will confirm your details and introduce you to your radiographer or sonographer in our quiet waiting room.',
	'k85a8eda2' => 'Bring: referral letter, photo ID. No calcium tablets for 24 hours before.',
