	'k869cfd15' => 'A direct line',
	'k86f57f70' => 'Runs the referral phone line, Monday to Friday 08:00–17:00. Speaks English and Dutch.',
	'k87068acb' => 'Hip and spine measured for the T-score that guides bone health decisions.',
	'k892f633a' => 'As nearby medical practices and allied healthcare clinics grew to rely on our same-day reporting workflow, we expanded our imaging capacity. In 2019, we installed our high-field MRI scanner, allowing us to deliver rapid cross-sectional imaging for complex neurological, spinal, and joint pathologies. Alongside MRI and CT, we integrated digital general radiography, high-resolution diagnostic ultrasound, DEXA bone densitometry, and dedicated mammography into our facility. Each modality was selected to provide local medical practitioners with a comprehensive, reliable outpatient diagnostic service situated just minutes from their practice doors.',
	'k8a5f479a' => 'Ultrasound examinations are carried out by our senior sonographer or consultant radiologists, covering abdominal, pelvic, small parts, and musculoskeletal assessments with real-time dynamic evaluation. Digital radiography provides rapid, low-dose general imaging across two standard views per requested region, including chest, spine, and extremity examinations. Both modalities operate with minimal waiting times and clear clinical protocols. Completed imaging datasets are immediately transferred to our digital archive for same-day review, allowing referring general practitioners and physiotherapists to receive structured diagnostic reports by 18:00 for morning and early afternoon appointments.',
