	'k8c8aa77b' => 'Signed PDF reports are delivered directly into your practice management system via secure digital transmission or encrypted email. Scans performed before 15:00 are finalized and sent before 18:00, allowing you to review findings and discuss management with your patient that evening. In the event of an acute or unexpected abnormality—such as an unsuspected fracture, vascular occlusion, or urgent mass lesion—our reporting radiologist contacts you by telephone within the hour. Clinicians can also upload outside imaging studies through our portal for formal second-opinion reviews at €150.',
