	'ka5cd3ed1' => 'Roles',
	'ka65f739a' => 'Our self-pay rates are fixed per individual study. General digital radiography for one region, including two standard views and report, is €65. Ultrasound examination of one anatomical region performed by our sonographer is €120. DEXA bone mineral density assessment covering the hip and lumbar spine with complete T-score reporting is €95. Combined bilateral mammography with breast ultrasound is €160. Computed tomography for one region, including contrast administration where necessary and independent double reading, is €290. Magnetic resonance imaging for one region, encompassing a 30 to 45 minute scan and double reading, is €380. Formal second opinions on outside imaging studies uploaded by your clinician are €150.',
