	'ke6134cb5' => 'Founded at Calder Quay in 2016',
	'ke652e242' => 'Abdomen, pelvis, small parts and joints, scanned by a sonographer or radiologist.',
	'ke6b53f5a' => 'Referrals arrive by portal, by email to referrals@nagi-imaging.example or by phone on +353 1 555 0148, Monday to Friday 08:00–17:00.',
	'ke79c6603' => 'Meet the team',
	'ke7e2b60a' => 'Doctors and clinicians can refer patients through three straightforward channels. You may submit patient requests through our encrypted online portal, transmit a standard referral letter to referrals@nagi-imaging.example, or contact our dedicated clinical referral line directly at +353 1 555 0148. Our referral desk is staffed by Grace Achterberg from Monday to Friday between 08:00 and 17:00, assisting your practice team with scheduling, protocol queries, and urgent booking arrangements. We ensure patients are contacted promptly following referral receipt to confirm their preferred appointment time.',
